#
# Test Grid 3x3 — Stateless Batch Build (.ev)
# Three-phase pattern: Create → Describe → Connect
#

# === PHASE 1: CREATE ALL ROOMS ===
@create/drop Test Cell A1;A1 : typeclasses.rooms.Room
#
@create/drop Test Cell A2;A2 : typeclasses.rooms.Room
#
@create/drop Test Cell A3;A3: typeclasses.rooms.Room
#
@create/drop Test Cell B1;B1 : typeclasses.rooms.Room
#
@create/drop Test Cell B2;B2 : typeclasses.rooms.Room
#
@create/drop Test Cell B3;B3 : typeclasses.rooms.Room
#
@create/drop Test Cell C1;C1 : typeclasses.rooms.Room
#
@create/drop Test Cell C2;C2 : typeclasses.rooms.Room
#
@create/drop Test Cell C3;C3 : typeclasses.rooms.Room
#

# === PHASE 2: DESCRIBE AND SET ROOM ATTRIBUTES ===

# Row A (north edge)
@desc Test Cell A1 =
  The northwest corner of a tidy 3×3 test grid. Chalk ticks mark the stones.
  A draft carries the dry scent of dust and new beginnings.
#
@desc Test Cell A2 =
  The northern middle cell. Footfalls sound crisp here, as if the room approves
  of clean topology.
#
@desc Test Cell A3 =
  The northeast corner of the grid. A draft toys with a stray thread of spider silk.
#

# Row B (center row)
@desc Test Cell B1 =
  The western middle cell. Scratches on the floor suggest many test runs past.
#
@desc Test Cell B2 =
  The exact center of the grid. A faint draft crosses here in neat right angles.
#
@desc Test Cell B3 =
  The eastern middle cell. Someone once stood here and tested exits, again and again.

# Row C (south edge)
@desc Test Cell C1 =
  The southwest corner. The stone underfoot is slightly warmer, as if well-traveled.
#

@desc Test Cell C2 =
  The southern middle cell. Echoes gather here before choosing a direction.
#

@desc Test Cell C3 =
  The southeast corner. The air is still; the room feels ready to be linked.
#

# === PHASE 3: CREATE ALL EXITS (BIDIRECTIONAL) ===

# Horizontal connections (west <-> east)
@tel A1
#
@open east;e,west;w = A2
#
@tel A2
#
@open east;e,west;w = A3
#
@tel B1
#
@open east;e,west;w = B2
#
@tel B2
#
@open east;e,west;w = B3
#
@tel C1
#
@open east;e,west;w = C2
#
@tel C2
#
@open east;e,west;w = C3
#

# Vertical connections (north <-> south)
@tel A1
#
@open south;s,north;n = B1
#
@tel B1
#
@open south;s,north;n = C1
#
@tel A2
#
@open south;s,north;n = B2
#
@tel B2
#
@open south;s,north;n = C2
#
@tel A3
#
@open south;s,north;n = B3
#
@tel B3
#
@open south;s,north;n = C3
#
@tel A1
#